  "_comment": "Negative: 'lineage evidence' that is not a source region. rkaf:versionLineageEvidence is class-ranged to rkaf:SourceFragment (§4.1); pointing it at the issuing authority names who would know rather than WHERE the document says so, and a version claim that resolves to no coordinates is exactly the inferred lineage the citation rule replaces."
